      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.02,
      550.68,
      542.54,
      576.15
    ],
    "text": "The Sri Lanka Air Force Women's Wing (Regular and Regular Reserve) Regulations, 1987, published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 539/15 of January 7, 1989 are hereby amended as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.02,
      584.68,
      542.55,
      598.15
    ],
    "text": "(1) by the substitution in sub-regulation (4) of regulation 20, for the words \u201cage of forty five years or on completion",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      92.04,
      596.68,
      542.55,
      622.15
    ],
    "text": "of a maximum period of twenty years of service, whichever occurs earlier.\u201d, of the words and figures \u201cage of fifty five (55) years or on completion of a period of twenty (20) years of service.\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.05,
      630.68,
      540.04,
      656.15
    ],
    "text": "(2) by the substitution in regulation 21, for the words \u201cage of fifty years,\u201d of the words and figures \u201cage of sixty (60)years.\u201d; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.04,
      664.68,
      542.57,
      690.15
    ],
    "text": "(3) by the substitution in sub-regulation (3) of regulation 35, for the words \u201cmaximum period of twenty years whichever occurs earlier.\u201d, of the words and figures \u201cperiod of twenty two (22) years.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
